  --- stderr
  <every stderr line, in order, normalised>

Every command runs through scripts/lib/compare_common.py run(): a memory-capped systemd scope
(MemoryMax=8G, MemorySwapMax=0) whose supervisor records how it really ended (`exit N`, `signal
